/*
 * GMS INTERNAL - REAL HARDWARE
 * ESP32-S3 / ESP-IDF v6.0.2
 *
 * Hardware:
 * ADS1115:
 *   A0 = Temperature
 *   A1 = Not Used
 *   A2 = Level
 *   A3 = Pressure
 *
 * I2C:
 *   SDA = GPIO8
 *   SCL = GPIO9
 *   Address = 0x48
 *
 * EWIG RS485:
 *   TX  = GPIO15
 *   RX  = GPIO16
 *   RTS = GPIO14
 *   Baudrate = 9600
 *   Slave ID = 1
 *
 * Features:
 * - Local Web Dashboard
 * - WiFi AP + Station
 * - DHCP / Static IP
 * - NVS Configuration
 * - MQTT TLS ThingsBoard
 * - ADS1115 Monitoring
 * - EWIG Modbus RTU
 *
 * BENCH TEST ONLY
 * NO RELAY CONTROL
 */

